      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure what the policies are on mainline vs 6.12. My working model was that if we want it on a branch, we want it on mainline, until an alternative arrives. I don\u0027t suspect an alternative will arise any time soon.\n\nBut I can defer this if it\u0027s undesirable, since we have a bringup branch too.",
